# 🛍️ FAQ BLOCK SNIPPET - SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR

## 1️⃣ **FAQ Block Snippet** - snippets/faq-block.liquid

```liquid
{% comment %}
  FAQ Block - Dynaamiset kysymys-rivit Theme Editorista
  Käyttö: {% render 'faq-block', faq_items: section.settings.faq_items %}
{% endcomment %}

{% assign lang = localization.language.iso_code | downcase %}

<!-- JSON-LD Schema -->
{% capture faq_json %}
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {% for item in faq_items %}
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "{{ item.question | escape }}",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "{{ item.answer | escape }}"
        }
      }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
{% endcapture %}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ faq_json | strip }}
</script>

<!-- Näkyvä FAQ-sisältö -->
<div class="faq-block">
  <h2 class="faq-block-title">
    {% case lang %}
      {% when 'fi' %}Usein kysytyt kysymykset
      {% when 'ru' %}Часто задаваемые вопросы
      {% else %}Frequently Asked Questions
    {% endcase %}
  </h2>
  
  <div class="faq-block-items">
    {% for item in faq_items %}
      <div class="faq-block-item">
        <h3 class="faq-block-question">
          {{ item.question }}
        </h3>
        <p class="faq-block-answer">
          {{ item.answer }}
        </p>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
```

